31,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"Everyone, listen! I'm the Seer, and I found the werewolf! It's Shion!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Shion,,That's a bold claim. Are you sure you aren't the werewolf trying to frame me?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"That was fast. Kenji, are you certain about this result?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Servas,,A shocking revelation so early. We must consider if this is a truth or a deception.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Yumi,,What?! Shion is the werewolf? I can't believe it!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Kenji,,I'm 100% sure! The divination doesn't lie!,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Shion,,A common tactic for werewolves is to fake being the Seer to eliminate a threat.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Kenji, if you are the Seer, why reveal yourself immediately? It makes you a target.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Servas,,"It is a risky strategy, but it provides the village with immediate direction.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Yumi,,I trust Kenji! He's always honest!,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I did it because we only have five people. We can't afford to waste time!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Shion,,Or you're desperate to get me out before I can manipulate the vote.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shion, you're being very defensive.","{""words"":5,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Servas,,The logic of the Seer's urgency is sound given our small numbers.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Yumi,,Let's believe Kenji! We have to!,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"Please, everyone, vote for Shion!","{""words"":5,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Shion,,You're making a mistake that will cost the village.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,"The evidence is circumstantial, but the Seer's claim is direct. I'll follow it.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Servas,,I shall cast my vote based on the Seer's guidance.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I'm voting for Shion!,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
